flowchart TD
    A[Service journey starts<br/><i>e.g. Change driving licence address</i>]
    A --> B[Journey executor presents current step<br/><i>e.g. What is your new address?</i>]

    B --> C[User responds<br/><i>e.g. I recently moved to 18 Station Road</i>]

    C --> D[Agent supports the current step:<br/>propose values;<br/>retrieve approved information;<br/>surface a conflict;<br/>make no suggestion;<br/>flag inconsistency;<br/>answer a journey question;<br/>prompt to exit or continue.]

    D --> E[Journey executor decides what happens next<br/><i>e.g. Show the proposed address for confirmation</i>]

    E -->|Present next step| B
    E -->|Journey complete| F[Journey completed]
    E -->|Exit journey| G[Return to orchestration]

    classDef default fill:#f8f8f8,stroke:#0b0c0c,color:#0b0c0c;